sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Airflow
    participant S as Tracking API
    participant I as dlt ingestion
    participant W as BigQuery warehouse
    participant D as dbt

    A->>I: Start hourly load
    I->>S: GET scan-events?since_offset=feedOffset
    loop Paginated feed
        S-->>I: Events + transport offsets
        alt Contract-valid record
            I->>W: MERGE valid row by event_id
        else Contract violation
            I->>W: MERGE row into quarantine
        end
    end
    I-->>A: Commit rows + extraction state
    A->>D: Run freshness gate + dbt build
    D->>W: Read raw, build core and marts
    D->>W: Test contracts, grain, relationships and coverage

    alt Gate or build fails
        D-->>A: Fail with control + affected data
        Note over A,D: Alert operator and repair or backfill
    else Build passes
        D-->>A: Publish successful run
        Note over W,D: Governed marts are ready for serving
    end
